.TH HXROOT 1 "August 2026" "v1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hxroot \- Modern fakechroot+fakeroot re-implementation with automatic proot fallback for Termux glibc
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hxroot
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fI--\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBhxroot\fR is a modern re-implementation of fakechroot and fakeroot supporting glibc on Termux. It provides high-performance path remapping via LD_PRELOAD and automatically falls back to proot for unsupported binaries.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB-h\fR, \fB--help\fR
Display help message and exit.
.SH USAGE
Obtain a rootfs (e.g. via proot-distro), convert absolute symlinks using \fBhxconvert\fR, and run commands inside hxroot.
.SH AUTHOR
Neltharion01 / bai-server team
